{"2590750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmorons", "steam_appid": 2590750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Universe…or become Spare Parts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Drudge! A disposable robot built to expand the Overlords empire - your mission - destroy the Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into a Cosmos filled with strange planets and alien hordes. Complete dangerous missions, harvest Planet Cores from doomed worlds and stack upgrades to transform into the Ultimate Drudge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/6cf4362e1a041355aaa0570d7585cf4f.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/6cf4362e1a041355aaa0570d7585cf4f.webm?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create an absurd, enemy-crushing build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies into XP and level up your Drudge. Most upgrades (Power-Ups and Tune-Ups) offer tough choices and lasting trade-offs that shape your build each run!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/e325a362fdb0259498afb024cc5409d8.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=600 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/e325a362fdb0259498afb024cc5409d8.webm?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/e325a362fdb0259498afb024cc5409d8.mp4?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gravity Combat &amp; Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely across planets, asteroids and space junk with your grapple ability, you’ll need it during the chaotic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/8918d2f4124375889c40620bd8022cad.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/8918d2f4124375889c40620bd8022cad.webm?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cosmic Chaos with Friends…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create teams with up to four players and tackle as many hostile Cosmoses as you can, coordinating builds and rescuing teammates. Survive the escalating chaos as each mission grows more dangerous…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/67d1bcdc4b628d0224bb45f5b1d200a1.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/67d1bcdc4b628d0224bb45f5b1d200a1.webm?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/67d1bcdc4b628d0224bb45f5b1d200a1.mp4?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How far will you go?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into the Universe every run! Each Cosmos is different. Complete missions, overwhelm the resistance, and trigger catastrophic events that destroy planets and Cosmoses. Use the harvested power to Program Your Drudge or Power Your Ship further into the Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Drudges die, the Overlord begrudgingly serves up clones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enough reading, The Overlord demands you sign up now! (or Wishlist)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/10940df169feaa8a33750a7a77638bba.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/10940df169feaa8a33750a7a77638bba.webm?t=1786306850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Universe…or become Spare Parts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Drudge! A disposable robot built to expand the Overlords empire - your mission - destroy the Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into a Cosmos filled with strange planets and alien hordes. Complete dangerous missions, harvest Planet Cores from doomed worlds and stack upgrades to transform into the Ultimate Drudge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/6cf4362e1a041355aaa0570d7585cf4f.poster.avif?t=1786306850\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590750/extras/6c